    "summary": "The user initiates a research-oriented inquiry into the limits of nation-state regulation of internet access for national security. Through a series of follow-up questions, the user pushes the assistant toward a more critical view of state power, prompting the assistant to provide normative stances on judicial oversight, the burden of proof, and the necessity of proportionality in digital governance.",
